      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t fully understand the purpose of this test here -- despite only `myconfig.v2` specifying `source_module_name`, the behaviors of `prebuilt_myconfig` and `prebuilt_myconfig.v2` do not look different? i.e. How would the expected testing behavior differ when `myconfig.v2` did not specify the `source_module_name` property?",
