      "writtenOn": "2024-03-16T01:48:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Are multiple prebuilt_myconfig.v* modules allowed to set the same source_module_name? If not, is there a mechanism to prevent it?\n\nI believe they should be allowed to set the same `source_module_name`. This property is used in `build/soong/android/prebuilt.go` to create a [connected tree](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/build/soong/+/7d53941629b5e7112ad4658c59dea1ac58a7cd6b:android/prebuilt.go;l\u003d425-431;drc\u003d972917d794e1f9a225fa3737cf648f4a8d044d31;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0), and [disable](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/build/soong/+/7d53941629b5e7112ad4658c59dea1ac58a7cd6b:android/prebuilt.go;l\u003d532-545;drc\u003d972917d794e1f9a225fa3737cf648f4a8d044d31;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0) the source or prebuilt which is not active in the current release configuration.",
      "parentUuid": "f9ab2a5f_630b1fcf",
      "revId": "dc1bdd97cd0872ae94f428373c025b5be17a190a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
